                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When a trailer goes down, your business slows down with it. Whether you're hauling freight across Florida or managing an entire fleet, having access to reliable semi trailer parts and experienced service can make the difference between staying on schedule and dealing with costly downtime.",
